async function renderBackup(){add(root,heading('备份与恢复','清册导出用于迁移资产；完整备份含账号和 Key 哈希，仅网页用户可下载。恢复会清除所有登录会话。'));
 const actions=section('导出');for(const [kind,label] of [['catalog','下载清册 YAML'],['full','下载完整备份 YAML']]){const a=el('a','button',label);a.href='/api/backup/export?kind='+kind;a.download='rollbook-'+kind+'.yaml';a.style.marginRight='12px';actions.append(a)}root.append(actions);
 const managed=section('服务器备份');root.append(managed);const files=await api('/api/backup/files');if(!files.length)managed.append(empty());for(const f of files){const row=el('div','row');add(row,el('strong','',f.kind==='daily'?'日备份':'周备份'),el('small','',`${f.created_at} · ${(f.size/1024).toFixed(1)} KiB`));const download=el('a','button','下载');download.href='/api/backup/files/'+encodeURIComponent(f.name)+'/download';download.download=f.name;row.append(download);const restore=el('button','danger','选择恢复');restore.onclick=async()=>{if(!confirm('提交这份备份供审批恢复？'))return;restore.disabled=true;try{const item=await api('/api/backup/files/'+encodeURIComponent(f.name)+'/restore',{method:'POST'});managed.append(message('已提交待审批：'+item.id));await renderImports()}catch(e){managed.append(message(e.message,'error'))}finally{restore.disabled=false}};row.append(restore);managed.append(row)}
 const upload=section('提交待确认导入');const form=el('form');const mode=el('select');for(const [value,label] of [['merge','合并导入：只新增或更新，保留其他资产和历史'],['catalog','清册恢复：替换当前清册'],['full','完整恢复：替换清册、账号与 Key']]){const option=el('option','',label);option.value=value;mode.append(option)}const file=el('input');file.type='file';file.accept='.yaml,.yml,text/yaml';file.required=true;const send=el('button','primary','校验并提交');send.type='submit';add(form,mode,file,send);upload.append(form);root.append(upload);
 form.onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();send.disabled=true;try{let data=await file.files[0].text();if(mode.value==='merge'&&!/^kind:\s*merge\s*$/m.test(data)){if(/^kind:\s*\w+\s*$/m.test(data))throw Error('请选择与 YAML kind 一致的导入方式；旧备份请选择恢复');data='kind: merge\n'+data}if(mode.value!=='merge'&&!new RegExp('^kind:\\s*'+mode.value+'\\s*$','m').test(data))throw Error('YAML kind 与所选恢复方式不一致');const item=await api('/api/backup/import',{method:'POST',body:data,headers:{'Content-Type':'application/yaml'}});upload.append(message('已提交待审批：'+JSON.stringify(item.preview)));await renderImports()}catch(err){upload.append(message(err.message,'error'))}finally{send.disabled=false}};
 const csvSection=section('CSV 合并导入');const csvForm=el('form');const csvType=el('select');for(const [value,label] of [['host','主机'],['network','网段'],['ip','IP'],['service','服务']]){const option=el('option','',label);option.value=value;csvType.append(option)}const template=el('a','button','下载模板');const updateTemplate=()=>{template.href='/api/backup/csv/template?type='+csvType.value;template.download='rollbook-'+csvType.value+'.csv'};csvType.onchange=updateTemplate;updateTemplate();const csvFile=el('input');csvFile.type='file';csvFile.accept='.csv,text/csv';csvFile.required=true;const csvSend=el('button','primary','预览并提交审批');csvSend.type='submit';add(csvForm,csvType,template,csvFile,csvSend);csvSection.append(csvForm);root.append(csvSection);csvForm.onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();csvSend.disabled=true;try{const item=await api('/api/backup/csv/import?type='+csvType.value,{method:'POST',body:await csvFile.files[0].arrayBuffer(),headers:{'Content-Type':'text/csv'}});csvSection.append(message('已提交待审批：'+JSON.stringify(item.preview)));await renderImports()}catch(err){csvSection.append(message(err.message,'error'))}finally{csvSend.disabled=false}};
 await renderImports()}
async function renderImports(){const old=$('#backup-imports');if(old)old.remove();const s=section('导入审批');s.id='backup-imports';root.append(s);const list=await api('/api/backup/imports');if(!list.length){s.append(empty());return}for(const item of list){const row=el('div','row');const main=add(el('div','row-main'),el('strong','',item.kind==='merge'?'合并导入':item.kind==='full'?'完整恢复':'清册恢复'),el('small','',`${item.proposer} · ${item.created_at} · ${item.state}`));row.append(main);if(item.state==='pending'){const p=item.preview;if(item.kind!=='merge'&&p.differences){const details=el('div','diff');for(const [type,count] of Object.entries(p.object_differences||p.differences))if(count.added||count.modified||count.deleted)details.append(el('p','',`${type}：新增 ${count.added}、修改 ${count.modified}、删除 ${count.deleted}`));for(const o of p.objects||[])details.append(el('p','',`${o.action==='delete'?'删除':o.action==='add'?'新增':'修改'} ${o.type} ${o.id}`));details.append(el('p','','将丢失的变更：'+(p.lost_changes||[]).length));for(const c of p.lost_changes||[])details.append(el('p','',`${c.id} · ${c.object_id} · ${c.action} · ${c.reason} · ${c.state}`));row.append(details)}else row.append(el('pre','diff',JSON.stringify(p,null,2)));for(const [act,label,cls] of [['approve',item.kind==='merge'?'批准合并':'批准恢复','danger'],['reject','驳回','ghost']]){const b=el('button',cls,label);b.onclick=async()=>{if(act==='approve'&&!confirm(item.kind==='merge'?'确认合并这些对象？审批时将重新校验 rev 和关联关系。':'确认整库恢复？恢复前会保存当前库备份，所有登录会话将失效。若数据有变化，系统会要求重新提交预览。'))return;b.disabled=true;try{await api(`/api/backup/imports/${item.id}/${act}`,{method:'POST'});if(act==='approve'&&item.kind!=='merge'){showLogin()}else await renderImports()}catch(err){s.append(message(err.message,'error'));b.disabled=false}};row.append(b)}}s.append(row)}}

// 表单字段与数据库中的业务模型保持一致；关联项从当前清册选择。
const formFields={
 location:['kind','parent_id','city','region','address','timezone','description'],
 uplink:['location_id','isp','type','bandwidth','public_ipv4','public_ipv4_addr','public_ipv6','ddns','inbound_ports_json','edge_device_id','account_ref'],
 host:['kind','net_role','uplink_id','parent_host_id','location_id','model','os','os_version','resources_json','mgmt_url'],
 network:['cidr','location_id','router_id','uplink_id','vlan_id','gateway','dhcp_range','purpose'],
 ip:['address','network_id','host_id','interface','mac','assign'],
 service:['host_id','kind','deploy_method','upstream_json','owner','config_path','docs_url'],
 port:['service_id','bind','port','protocol','purpose'],
 endpoint:['service_id','kind','url','via_json','auth','exposure','nav_card_json'],
 dependency:['from_id','to_id','kind','note'],
 version:['service_id','current_version','current_source','latest_version','latest_source','latest_url','eol_date','pinned','pinned_reason','checked_at'],
 credential:['target_id','vault','item_ref','purpose'],
 note:['target_id','kind','body_md']
};
const requiredFields={location:['kind'],uplink:['location_id'],host:['kind','location_id'],network:['cidr','location_id'],ip:['address','host_id'],service:['host_id'],port:['service_id','port','protocol'],endpoint:['service_id','kind','url'],dependency:['from_id','to_id','kind'],version:['service_id'],credential:['target_id','vault','item_ref'],note:['target_id','kind','body_md']};
const choices={status:['在用','停用','计划中'],source:['人工','agent','自动发现'],confidence:['低','中','高'],kind:{location:['站点','房间','机柜','桌面'],host:['物理机','NAS','虚拟机','LXC','容器','网络设备'],endpoint:['内网直连','反向代理','Cloudflare Tunnel','导航页卡片'],note:['运维笔记','故障','决策','待办']},net_role:['光猫','主路由','旁路由','交换机','AP'],type:{uplink:['光纤宽带','专线','4G·5G','其他']},public_ipv4:['无或CGNAT','动态公网','固定公网','待核实'],assign:['静态','DHCP保留','动态'],protocol:['tcp','udp']};
const relationType={parent_id:'location',location_id:'location',uplink_id:'uplink',edge_device_id:'host',account_ref:'credential',parent_host_id:'host',router_id:'host',network_id:'network',host_id:'host',service_id:'service'};
const editableTypes=Object.keys(formFields);
async function renderAssets(){add(root,heading('资产维护','按类型查看、新建和维护清册。'));const shortcuts=el('div','controls');for(const [label,view] of [['站点','sites'],['主机浏览树','hosts'],['网段','networks'],['服务','services']]){const b=el('button','ghost',label);b.onclick=()=>{if(view==='services'){const select=document.querySelector('.asset-type-select');select.value='service';select.dispatchEvent(new Event('change'))}else navigate(view)};shortcuts.append(b)}root.append(shortcuts);const bar=el('div','controls');const type=el('select','field asset-type-select');for(const key of editableTypes){const option=el('option','',types[key]);option.value=key;type.append(option)}const create=el('button','primary','新建');const list=el('div','grid');let seq=0;create.onclick=()=>assetForm(type.value);type.onchange=load;add(bar,type,create);add(root,bar,list);await load();async function load(){const mine=++seq;clear(list);try{const objects=await api('/api/browse?type='+type.value);if(mine!==seq)return;if(!objects.length){list.append(empty('暂无记录，可从这里新建'));return}for(const o of objects)list.append(card(o,o.status==='停用'?'停用 · '+o.id:o.id))}catch(e){if(mine===seq)list.append(message(e.message,'error'))}}}
function choiceValues(type,field){const value=choices[field];return Array.isArray(value)?value:value?.[type]||null}
async function assetForm(type,original=null){const related={};const needed=new Set(formFields[type].map(f=>relationType[f]).filter(Boolean));if(['dependency','credential','note'].includes(type))for(const t of editableTypes)needed.add(t);if(type==='endpoint')needed.add('service');await Promise.all([...needed].map(async t=>{related[t]=await api('/api/browse?type='+t)}));
 modal(original?'编辑'+types[type]:'新建'+types[type],(box,close,overlay)=>{const form=el('form','asset-form');const controls={};const id=el('input');if(!original){id.value=type+':'+Array.from(crypto.getRandomValues(new Uint8Array(16)),x=>x.toString(16).padStart(2,'0')).join('');id.required=true;add(form,add(el('label','','ID（可修改）'),id))}const name=el('input');name.value=original?.name||'';name.required=true;add(form,add(el('label','','名称'),name));for(const field of ['status','source','confidence',...formFields[type]]){const values=choiceValues(type,field);const relation=relationType[field];let input;
 if(relation||field==='from_id'||field==='to_id'||field==='target_id'||field==='via_json'){
 input=el('select');if(field==='via_json'){input.multiple=true;input.size=4}else{const blank=el('option','','请选择');blank.value='';input.append(blank)}
 const pool=relation?related[relation]:Object.values(related).flat();for(const o of pool){if(o.id===original?.id)continue;const option=el('option','',literal(`${t(types[o.type])} · ${o.name} (${o.id})`));option.value=o.id;input.append(option)}
 }else if(values){input=el('select');if(!requiredFields[type].includes(field)){const blank=el('option','','请选择');blank.value='';input.append(blank)}for(const value of values){const option=el('option','',literal(enumLabel(field,value)));option.value=value;input.append(option)}}else if(field.endsWith('_json')||['description','note','body_md'].includes(field)){input=el('textarea')}else{input=el('input');if(field==='port'||field==='vlan_id')input.type='number';if(field==='pinned')input.type='checkbox'}
 const old=field in (original?.fields||{})?original.fields[field]:original?.[field];if(input.multiple){let arr=old;try{if(typeof arr==='string')arr=JSON.parse(arr)}catch{}for(const option of input.options)option.selected=Array.isArray(arr)&&arr.includes(option.value)}else if(input.type==='checkbox')input.checked=Boolean(old);else if(old!=null)input.value=typeof old==='object'?JSON.stringify(old):String(old);
 input.required=requiredFields[type].includes(field);controls[field]=input;add(form,add(el('label','',field+(input.required?' *':'')),input))}
 const reason=el('input');reason.required=true;reason.placeholder=t('例如：登记新主机、更新服务配置');add(form,add(el('label','','操作原因 *'),reason));const errors=el('div','error');const submit=el('button','primary',original?'保存修改':'创建');submit.type='submit';add(form,errors,add(el('div','modal-actions'),close,submit));box.append(form);
 form.onsubmit=async event=>{event.preventDefault();errors.textContent='';submit.disabled=true;try{const fields={};for(const [key,input] of Object.entries(controls)){if(['status','source','confidence'].includes(key))continue;let value=input.multiple?[...input.selectedOptions].map(x=>x.value):input.type==='checkbox'?Number(input.checked):input.value.trim();if(value===''&&!original)continue;if(key.endsWith('_json')&&typeof value==='string'&&value){try{value=JSON.parse(value)}catch{throw Error(key+'：请输入有效 JSON')}}if((key==='port'||key==='vlan_id')&&value!=='')value=Number(value);fields[key]=value===''?null:value}
 const common={};for(const key of ['status','source','confidence'])if(controls[key].value)common[key]=controls[key].value;
 if(original){const patch={name:name.value.trim(),fields,...common};await api('/api/assets/'+encodeURIComponent(original.id),{method:'PATCH',body:JSON.stringify({rev:original.rev,patch,reason:reason.value.trim()})});overlay.remove();await openObject(original.id,type)}else{const object={id:id.value.trim(),type,name:name.value.trim(),fields,...common};await api('/api/assets',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({object,base_rev:0,reason:reason.value.trim()})});overlay.remove();await openObject(object.id,type)}}catch(e){errors.textContent=e.message;submit.disabled=false}}})}
async function refreshObject(o){await openObject(o.id,o.type)}
function detailActions(o){const bar=el('div','controls detail-actions');const button=(label,fn,cls='ghost')=>{const b=el('button',cls,label);b.onclick=fn;bar.append(b)};
 if(formFields[o.type]&&o.type!=='note')button('编辑',()=>assetForm(o.type,o));
 button('标记核实',async()=>{const reason=prompt('核实原因');if(!reason)return;try{await api('/api/assets/'+encodeURIComponent(o.id)+'/verify',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({rev:o.rev,reason})});refreshObject(o)}catch(e){alert(e.message)}});
 button('加笔记',()=>modal('添加笔记',(box,close,overlay)=>{const kind=el('select');for(const value of ['运维笔记','故障','决策','待办']){const opt=el('option','',literal(enumLabel('kind',value)));opt.value=value;kind.append(opt)}const body=el('textarea');body.required=true;const reason=el('input');reason.required=true;const form=el('form');add(form,add(el('label','','类型'),kind),add(el('label','','内容'),body),add(el('label','','原因'),reason));const err=el('div','error');const save=el('button','primary','保存笔记');save.type='submit';add(form,err,add(el('div','modal-actions'),close,save));box.append(form);form.onsubmit=async event=>{event.preventDefault();try{await api('/api/notes',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({id:o.id,rev:o.rev,kind:kind.value,body_md:body.value,reason:reason.value})});overlay.remove();refreshObject(o)}catch(e){err.textContent=e.message}}}));
 if(o.type==='host'){if(o.status!=='停用')button('停用主机',()=>offlineDialog(o));else button('恢复主机',()=>restoreDialog(o))}
 button('删除',()=>deleteDialog(o),'danger');return bar}
function deleteDialog(o){modal('删除'+o.name,(box,close,overlay)=>{box.append(el('p','muted','删除后无法撤销。请确认两次。被引用时会列出引用方。'));const reason=el('input');reason.placeholder=t('删除原因');reason.required=true;const form=el('form');add(form,add(el('label','','操作原因'),reason));const err=el('div','error');const yes=el('button','danger','继续删除');yes.type='submit';add(form,err,add(el('div','modal-actions'),close,yes));box.append(form);form.onsubmit=async event=>{event.preventDefault();if(!confirm(`第二次确认：删除 ${o.name}？`))return;yes.disabled=true;try{await api('/api/assets/'+encodeURIComponent(o.id),{method:'DELETE',body:JSON.stringify({rev:o.rev,reason:reason.value})});overlay.remove();navigate('assets')}catch(e){err.textContent=e.message;yes.disabled=false}}})}
async function offlineDialog(o){try{const data=await api('/api/hosts/'+encodeURIComponent(o.id)+'/offline');modal('停用主机 · 预览影响',(box,close,overlay)=>{const preview=data.preview;for(const [key,label] of [['services','服务'],['ips','IP'],['endpoints','入口']])box.append(el('p','muted',`${label}：${preview[key].map(x=>x.name).join('、')||'无'}`));const options={};for(const [key,label] of [['services','连带停用服务'],['ips','释放 IP'],['endpoints','标记入口不可用']]){const input=el('input');input.type='checkbox';options[key]=input;add(box,add(el('label','check-row',''),input,el('span','',label)))}const reason=el('input');reason.required=true;reason.placeholder=t('停用原因');const err=el('div','error');const yes=el('button','danger','确认停用');const form=el('form');add(form,add(el('label','','操作原因'),reason),err,add(el('div','modal-actions'),close,yes));box.append(form);form.onsubmit=async event=>{event.preventDefault();yes.disabled=true;try{await api('/api/hosts/'+encodeURIComponent(o.id)+'/offline',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({rev:o.rev,reason:reason.value,options:Object.fromEntries(Object.entries(options).map(([k,v])=>[k,v.checked]))})});overlay.remove();refreshObject(o)}catch(e){err.textContent=e.message;yes.disabled=false}}})}catch(e){alert(e.message)}}
async function restoreDialog(o){try{const data=await api('/api/hosts/'+encodeURIComponent(o.id)+'/offline');if(!data.operation_id)throw Error('没有可恢复的停用记录');modal('恢复主机',(box,close,overlay)=>{const reason=el('input');reason.required=true;reason.placeholder=t('恢复原因');const err=el('div','error');const form=el('form');const yes=el('button','primary','恢复');add(form,add(el('label','','操作原因'),reason),err,add(el('div','modal-actions'),close,yes));box.append(form);form.onsubmit=async event=>{event.preventDefault();yes.disabled=true;try{const result=await api('/api/hosts/'+encodeURIComponent(o.id)+'/restore',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify({operation_id:data.operation_id,reason:reason.value})});overlay.remove();await refreshObject(o);if(result.skipped.length)root.prepend(message('以下对象后来被修改，已跳过恢复：'+result.skipped.join('、')))}catch(e){err.textContent=e.message;yes.disabled=false}}})}catch(e){alert(e.message)}}
